      "title": "Video edit: raise the frame rate of a clip 2 or 4 times with FILM",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Video edit: raise the frame rate of a clip 2 or 4 times with FILM\n\nMakes new frames between the frames of your clip with FILM and raises its frame rate 2 or 4 times, with the sound kept or left out. Built from Comfy's template utility-frame_interpolation-film.\n\n## Models\n\n- [film_net_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/frame_interpolation/resolve/main/frame_interpolation/film_net_fp16.safetensors): FILM frame interpolation, [Apache-2.0](https://github.com/google-research/frame-interpolation).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
